---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Event Roadmap | Confluence" description="Configurable Confluence event lifecycle and milestone information."><main class="feature-page"><header class="feature-head"><a class="back-link" href="/">← Confluence home</a><p class="eyebrow">EVENT LIFECYCLE / CONFIGURABLE DEMO</p><h1>A path from<br/><em>idea to impact.</em></h1><p>These are example stages only. Dates and completion states are unconfigured until confirmed by organisers.</p></header><section id="roadmap-world" class="roadmap-world" aria-live="polite"><div class="roadmap-toolbar"><label for="roadmap-filter">Show stages</label><select id="roadmap-filter"><option value="all">All stages</option><option value="upcoming">Upcoming</option><option value="active">Active</option><option value="completed">Completed</option><option value="delayed">Delayed</option><option value="unavailable">Unannounced</option></select></div><div class="roadmap-list" id="roadmap-list"></div></section></main><script src="/js/roadmap.js" defer></script></SiteLayout>
